        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9037P, Knurled Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Appliance Pull is available in a wide selection of beautiful finish color options including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel ,and satin brass. This textured refrigerator handle is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware you'll need to install it on an appliance panel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ultima III 9037P Knurled Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9037P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9037P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9037P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/knurled-cabinet-pull-omnia-9037\"><b>Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/knurled-cabinet-knob-omnia-9036\"><b>Cabinet Knob</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
